":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db","content":"An open-source, in-process vector database by Alibaba — lightweight, lightning-fast, and battle-tested.","locale":"en"},"204":{"id":"/en/docs/db-1","page_id":"/en/docs/db","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db#key-features","content":"Key Features","locale":"en"},"205":{"id":"/en/docs/db-2","page_id":"/en/docs/db","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db#what-is-next","content":"What is Next?","locale":"en"},"206":{"id":"/en/docs/db-3","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db","content":"**Zvec** is an open-source, fast, lightweight, and feature-rich vector database that runs entirely **in-process** — no server, daemon, or external infrastructure required. Just install the package and start indexing and querying vectors right away 🚀.","locale":"en"},"207":{"id":"/en/docs/db-4","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db","content":"Vector databases are commonly used to power AI applications like semantic search, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), recommendation systems, and other similarity-based workflows.","locale":"en"},"208":{"id":"/en/docs/db-5","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db","content":"Zvec can serve as a **standalone vector database** for end-to-end storage and search, or it can be **seamlessly integrated into existing search systems** (such as traditional SQL databases) as a dedicated vector search engine.","locale":"en"},"209":{"id":"/en/docs/db-6","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db","content":"**Battle-tested** across demanding production workloads within Alibaba Group, Zvec delivers **production-grade**, **low-latency** and **scalable** similarity search. With its minimal-dependency, in-process design, Zvec is well-suited for virtually any scenario:","locale":"en"},"210":{"id":"/en/docs/db-7","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db","content":"💻 From **rapid prototyping** and **local development**","locale":"en"},"211":{"id":"/en/docs/db-8","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db","content":"📱 To **embedded applications** and **edge deployments**","locale":"en"},"212":{"id":"/en/docs/db-9","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db","content":"🌐 All the way to **billion-scale, production-grade systems**","locale":"en"},"213":{"id":"/en/docs/db-10","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db#key-features","content":"⚡ **Blazing Fast**: Scale to billions of vectors with sub-millisecond search latency.","locale":"en"},"214":{"id":"/en/docs/db-11","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db#key-features","content":"🧩 **Simple, Just Works**: A single package is all you need — pure local, just install and start searching in seconds. No servers, no config, no fuss.","locale":"en"},"215":{"id":"/en/docs/db-12","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db#key-features","content":"✨ **Dense + Sparse Vectors**: Work with both dense and sparse embeddings, with native support for multi-vector queries in a single call.","locale":"en"},"216":{"id":"/en/docs/db-13","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db#key-features","content":"🎯 **Hybrid Search**: Combine semantic similarity with structured filters for precise results.","locale":"en"},"217":{"id":"/en/docs/db-14","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db#key-features","content":"🛡️ **Durable Storage**: Write-ahead logging (WAL) guarantees persistence — data is never lost, even on process crash or power failure.","locale":"en"},"218":{"id":"/en/docs/db-15","page_id":"/en/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db#key-features","content":"🔒 **Concurrent Access**: Multiple processes can read the same collection simultaneously; writes are single-process exclusive.","locale":"en"},"219":{"id":"/en/doc