arks","content":"Zvec-Grep is evaluated on complete agent tasks, not only isolated search latency. The benchmarks ask whether better retrieval helps an agent produce a strong answer with less context, fewer tool calls, and less time.","locale":"en"},"540":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-9","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","content":"Every case compares the same task, agent, model, prompt, environment, and limits. The treatment adds only a prepared Zvec-Grep index, tools, and standard usage guidance. Index preparation is measured separately from agent execution time.","locale":"en"},"541":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-10","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"Workload","locale":"en"},"542":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-11","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"Quality","locale":"en"},"543":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-12","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"Input tokens","locale":"en"},"544":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-13","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"Tool calls","locale":"en"},"545":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-14","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"Agent time","locale":"en"},"546":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-15","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"Coding · SWE-QA-Bench","locale":"en"},"547":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-16","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"**+1.50 pp**","locale":"en"},"548":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-17","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"**−47.3%**","locale":"en"},"549":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-18","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"**−58.6%**","locale":"en"},"550":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-19","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"**−37.5%**","locale":"en"},"551":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-20","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"General text · BrowseComp-Plus","locale":"en"},"552":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-21","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"**+0.33 pp**","locale":"en"},"553":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-22","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"**−37.56%**","locale":"en"},"554":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-23","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"**−43.52%**","locale":"en"},"555":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-24","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"**−38.58%**","locale":"en"},"556":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-25","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#results-at-a-glance","content":"The coding result covers 20 tasks across 11 repositories with three runs per profile. The general-text result covers 80 cases over 100,195 documents with two trials per profile.","locale":"en"},"557":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-26","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-what-is-measured","content":"**Answer quality:** task-specific judge score or accuracy.","locale":"en"},"558":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-27","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-what-is-measured","content":"**Input tokens:** model context consumed while the agent works.","locale":"en"},"559":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-28","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-what-is-measured","content":"**Tool calls:** search and inspection actions recorded in the trajectory.","locale":"en"},"560":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-29","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-what-is-measured","content":"**Agent wall time:** task execution time, excluding Zvec-Grep index preparation.","locale":"en"},"561":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-30","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#1-what-is-measured","content":"Quality should stay stable or improve. Tokens, tool calls, and wall time should decrease.","locale":"en"},"562":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-31","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#swe-qa-bench","content":"Measures repository-level, cross-file, and multi-hop software-engineering question answering. It is designed for questions where the relevant implementation is distributed across a codebase and the entry point is not known in advance.","locale":"en"},"563":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-32","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#swe-qa-bench","content":"Read the SWE-QA-Bench setup and methodology","locale":"en"},"564":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-33","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#browsecomp-plus","content":"Measures multi-document evidence retrieval and answer accuracy over a large, fixed text corpus. It tests whether ranked semantic and lexical evidence reduces broad document scanning without lowering answer quality.","locale":"en"},"565":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-34","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#browsecomp-plus","content":"Read the BrowseComp-Plus setup and methodology","locale":"en"},"566":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-35","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#3-how-to-interpret-the-results","content":"The results show the effect of adding Zvec-Grep to an agent workflow; they are not a raw CLI latency comparison. Agent behavior is stochastic, so repeated-run averages are more useful than a single trial.","locale":"en"},"567":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-36","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#3-how-to-interpret-the-results","content":"The largest efficiency gains appear when a task requires semantic discovery, cross-file synthesis, or evidence spread across many documents. For a known literal or symbol, native ripgrep may still be the most direct route.","locale":"en"},"568":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-37","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#4-reproduce-the-evaluation","content":"Both suites pin their inputs and dependencies, keep generated artifacts outside the agent-visible workspace, and provide their own runner and reporting workflow.","locale":"en"},"569":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-38","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#4-reproduce-the-evaluation","content":"Open the complete benchmark documentation","locale":"en"},"570":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","type":"page","content":"CLI Reference","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products","Zvec-Grep","Guides"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","locale":"en"},"571":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli-0","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","content":"Find the main zg commands and the installed reference for searching, indexing, configuration, and connecting AI agents.","locale":"en"},"572":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli-1","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli#command-map","content":"Command Map","locale":"en"},"573":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli-2","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli#common-starting-points","content":"Common Starting Points","locale":"en"},"574":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli-3","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli#use-the-installed-reference","content":"Use the Installed Reference","locale":"en"},"575":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli-4","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","content":"`zg` is the terminal and scripting interface to the same local search layer used by AI agents. Start with the command overview, then open the topic guide when you need retrieval or indexing details.","locale":"en"},"576":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli-5","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/cli","content":"Options can evolve between releases. Run `zg --help`, `zg --help <co