":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server#manage-the-service","content":"Use foreground mode when you want the process and logs in the current terminal:","locale":"en"},"819":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server-23","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server#client-mode","content":"The CLI supports `direct`, `server`, and `auto` modes. Override the default `auto` mode with `ZVEC_GREP_MODE` or `--mode`:","locale":"en"},"820":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server-24","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server#client-mode","content":"`ZVEC_GREP_SERVER_URL` selects the service URL used by CLI clients.","locale":"en"},"821":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server-25","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server#mcp-toolsets","content":"`zg --server --stdio` starts or reuses the daemon and proxies MCP over stdin/stdout. The default `agent` toolset exposes only `zvec_grep_search`. Use `--mcp-toolset full` on `zg --install` or `zg --server` to also expose `zvec_grep_rg`, `zvec_grep_index`, `zvec_grep_index_drop`, `zvec_grep_index_status`, and `zvec_grep_server_status`.","locale":"en"},"822":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server-26","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server#listen-address-and-authentication","content":"The service listens on loopback and defaults to `127.0.0.1:7999`. Override the address when starting it explicitly:","locale":"en"},"823":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server-27","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server#listen-address-and-authentication","content":"Authentication is disabled by default on loopback. Use a token file or environment variable to require Bearer authentication:","locale":"en"},"824":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server-28","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server#listen-address-and-authentication","content":"Related settings are `ZVEC_GREP_SERVER_TOKEN`, `ZVEC_GREP_SERVER_TOKEN_FILE`, and `ZVEC_GREP_HOME`. Workspace indexes remain under `<root>/.zvec-grep/`.","locale":"en"},"825":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server-29","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server#listen-address-and-authentication","content":"Server logs are stored in `<home>/daemon/logs/server.log`; startup failures are recorded in `<home>/daemon/bootstrap.log`. The default home is `~/.zvec-grep`.","locale":"en"},"826":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server-30","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server#listen-address-and-authentication","content":"Restart the service after changing environment settings that affect its Embedding runtime.","locale":"en"},"827":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server-31","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/server#listen-address-and-authentication","content":"For current options, run `zg --help server` and `zg --help environment`. If the service does not become ready, see Troubleshooting.","locale":"en"},"828":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","type":"page","content":"Supported Content","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products","Zvec-Grep","Guides"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","locale":"en"},"829":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-0","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","content":"See how Zvec-Grep extracts code, documents, and structured text, and which files are skipped.","locale":"en"},"830":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-1","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#structure-aware-code","content":"Structure-aware code","locale":"en"},"831":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-2","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#documents-and-structured-text","content":"Documents and structured text","locale":"en"},"832":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-3","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#images","content":"Images","locale":"en"},"833":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-4","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#content-currently-skipped","content":"Content currently skipped","locale":"en"},"834":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-5","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","content":"Zvec-Grep assigns each admitted file to an extraction path. Structure-aware extractors preserve useful source context; other text files fall back to plain chunks.","locale":"en"},"835":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-6","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#structure-aware-code","content":"The following languages preserve symbols, signatures, breadcrumbs, and surrounding source:","locale":"en"},"836":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-7","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#structure-aware-code","content":"C and C++","locale":"en"},"837":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-8","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#structure-aware-code","content":"Go","locale":"en"},"838":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-9","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#structure-aware-code","content":"Java","locale":"en"},"839":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-10","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#structure-aware-code","content":"JavaScript and JSX","locale":"en"},"840":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-11","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#structure-aware-code","content":"TypeScript and TSX","locale":"en"},"841":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-12","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#structure-aware-code","content":"Python","locale":"en"},"842":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-13","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#structure-aware-code","content":"Rust","locale":"en"},"843":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-14","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#structure-aware-code","content":"Vue and Svelte component scripts also use structural extraction where possible.","locale":"en"},"844":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-15","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#documents-and-structured-text","content":"Content","locale":"en"},"845":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-16","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#documents-and-structured-text","content":"Indexed representation","locale":"en"},"846":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-17","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#documents-and-structured-text","content":"Markdown and MDX","locale":"en"},"847":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-18","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#documents-and-structured-text","content":"Heading sections and breadcrumbs","locale":"en"},"848":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-19","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#documents-and-structured-text","content":"TXT, RST, HTML, XML","locale":"en"},"849":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-20","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#documents-and-structured-text","content":"Plain-text chunks","locale":"en"},"850":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-21","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#documents-and-structured-text","content":"CSV, JSON, JSONC, TOML, YAML","locale":"en"},"851":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-22","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#documents-and-structured-text","content":"Plain-text chunks","locale":"en"},"852":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-23","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#documents-and-structured-text","content":"Other non-binary files","locale":"en"},"853":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-24","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#documents-and-structured-text","content":"Plain-text fallback","locale":"en"},"854":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-25","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#documents-and-structured-text","content":"Other recognized code such as Ruby, PHP, Swift, Kotlin, C#, Scala, shell, SQL, and CSS currently uses plain-text chunks when no structural grammar is available.","locale":"en"},"855":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-26","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#images","content":"Images are not indexed. Explicitly including GIF, JPEG, PNG, or WebP files, or selecting a multimodal model, does not enable image indexing.","locale":"en"},"856":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-27","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#content-currently-skipped","content":"PDF and Office files, archives, compiled artifacts, audio, video, database files, empty files, binaries detected by extension or content sampling, and files above the configured size limit are not indexed.","locale":"en"},"857":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-28","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#content-currently-skipped","content":"Use `zg --index --debug` to inspect skipped-file counts and samples. Scope discovery with `--glob`, file types, ignore files, depth, and maximum file size.","locale":"en"},"858":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Troubleshooting","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products","Zvec-Grep","Advanced"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","locale":"en"},"859":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnose installation, indexing, search, local-service, Agent connection, and remote-embedding problems.","locale":"en"},"860":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-zg-command-is-unavailable","content":"The `zg` Command Is Unavailable","locale":"en"},"861":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-index-is-missing-or-stale","content":"The Index Is Missing or Stale","locale":"en"},"862":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Search Results Are Empty or Weak","locale":"en"},"863":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#explicit-server-mode-is-not-ready","content":"Explicit Server Mode Is Not Ready","locale":"en"},"864":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#an-agent-cannot-use-zvec-grep","content":"An Agent Cannot Use Zvec-Grep","locale":"en"},"865":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#remote-embedding-is-denied","content":"Remote Embedding Is Denied","locale":"en"},"866":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#reset-safely","content":"Reset Safely","locale":"en"},"867":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","content":"Start with three checks:","locale":"en"},"868":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-zg-command-is-unavailable","content":"The npm installer requires Node.js 14.14 or newer; `zg` itself runs as a native executable:","locale":"en"},"869":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-zg-command-is-unavailable","content":"If npm succeeds but `zg` is still missing, add npm's global binary directory to your shell `PATH`.","locale":"en"},"870":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-zg-command-is-unavailable","content":"If npm skipped the package's installation scripts, enable them and run `npm rebuild -g @zvec/zvec-grep --allow-scripts=@zvec/zvec-grep --foreground-scripts` to materialize the native executable.","locale":"en"},"871":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-index-is-missing-or-stale","content":"Run commands from the intended workspace root:","locale":"en"},"872":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-index-is-missing-or-stale","content":"Use `--rebuild` when changing the embedding model or when status reports an incompatible index. For an incompatible index, specify the desired model and scan rules again; existing data is not migrated in place.","locale":"en"},"873":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Use `--rg` for known text, identifiers, paths, or regex.","locale":"en"},"874":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Use `--fts` for known terms that need ranking.","locale":"en"},"875":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Use the default hybrid query when wording or location is unknown.","locale":"en"},"876":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Restrict broad workspaces with `-g`, `-t`, or `-T`.","locale":"en"},"877":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Confirm that the content is indexed and the model fits it.","locale":"en"},"878":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"See Search Guide, Supported Content, and Embedding Models.","locale":"en"},"879":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#explicit-server-mode-is-not-ready","content":"This applies only when using `--mode server` or an HTTP MCP connection. Default stdio Agent integrations manage the service automatically.","locale":"en"},"880":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#explicit-server-mode-is-not-ready","content":"Run `zg --server run` when you need foreground logs. See Local Server for lifecycle, client mode, listen address, and authentication.","locale":"en"},"881":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#an-agent-cannot-use-zvec-grep","content":"Restart the Agent or open a new session. Exact identifiers and filenames may correctly use its native grep instead of Zvec-Grep. See Connect AI Agents.","locale":"en"},"882":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#remote-embedding-is-denied","content":"Inspect or grant the separate workspace authorization:","locale":"en"},"883":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#remote-embedding-is-denied","content":"Use `--allow-remote` for one command, or choose a local model when content must not leave the machine.","locale":"en"},"884":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#reset-safely","content":"`--drop` deletes the workspace index, not the source files. Indexed search remains unavailable until you build another index.","locale":"en"},"885":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#reset-safely","content":"When reporting a problem, include the version, operating system, failing command, relevant `zg --status`, and sanitized diagnostics. Remove credentials, private paths, and sensitive excerpts.","locale":"en"},"886":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#reset-safely","content":"Open a Zvec-Grep issue","locale":"en"},"887":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"page","content":"MCP Server","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products","Zvec","For Agents"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","locale":"en"},"888":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp-0","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp#quick-setup","content":"Quick Setup","locale":"en"},"889":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp-1","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp#qoder-recommended","content":"Qoder (Recommended)","locale":"en"},"890":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp-2","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp#claude-code","content":"Claude Code","locale":"en"},"891":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp-3","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp#claude-desktop","content":"Claude Desktop","locale":"en"},"892":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp-4","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp#local-development","content":"Local Development","locale":"en"},"893":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp-5","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp#verify-connection","content":"Verify Connection","locale":"en"},"894":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp-6","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp#quick-start-log-troubleshooting-scenario","content":"Quick Start (Log Troubleshooting Scenario)","locale":"en"},"895":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp-7","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp#semantic-search-examples","content":"Semantic Search Examples","locale":"en"},"896":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp-8","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp#tool-overview","content":"Tool Overview