rations/query/fts-27","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"Description","locale":"en"},"2295":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-28","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"`tokenizer_name`","locale":"en"},"2296":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-29","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"`str`","locale":"en"},"2297":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-30","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"`\"standard\"`","locale":"en"},"2298":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-31","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"Choose from `\"standard\"`, `\"ngram\"`, `\"whitespace\"`, and `\"jieba\"`. See Tokenizers.","locale":"en"},"2299":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-32","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"`filters`","locale":"en"},"2300":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-33","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"`list[str]`","locale":"en"},"2301":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-34","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"`[\"lowercase\"]`","locale":"en"},"2302":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-35","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"Token filters applied in sequence after tokenization. See Token Filters.","locale":"en"},"2303":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-36","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"`extra_params`","locale":"en"},"2304":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-37","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"`str`","locale":"en"},"2305":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-38","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"`\"\"`","locale":"en"},"2306":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-39","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"JSON string for tokenizer- and filter-specific configuration. See the configuration sections for each tokenizer and token filter.","locale":"en"},"2307":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-40","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#ftsindexparam-parameters","content":"Zvec supports **FTS-only collections** — you can create a collection with text fields and no vector fields at all.","locale":"en"},"2308":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-41","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#performing-full-text-search","content":"Zvec provides two query modes for full-text search, both using the `Fts` object within a `Query`:","locale":"en"},"2309":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-42","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#performing-full-text-search","content":"**Match String** — natural language input, automatically tokenized","locale":"en"},"2310":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-43","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#performing-full-text-search","content":"**Query String** — advanced expression syntax with boolean operators","locale":"en"},"2311":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-44","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#match-string","content":"Use `match_string` for natural language queries. The input is plain text — no special syntax or escaping is needed. It is tokenized using the same tokenizer configured on the field, and tokens are combined using the default operator (`OR` by default).","locale":"en"},"2312":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-45","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#match-string","content":"With the default `OR` operator, this returns documents containing **either** \"machine\" **or** \"learning\" (or both), ranked by BM25 relevance.","locale":"en"},"2313":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-46","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-string","content":"Use `query_string` for advanced queries with explicit boolean operators, required/excluded terms, and exact phrase matching.","locale":"en"},"2314":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-47","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-string","content":"With the default `OR` operator, a document must contain \"learning\" and must exclude \"neural\". Matching the optional phrase \"vector search\" also contributes to its score.","locale":"en"},"2315":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-48","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-string","content":"`query_string` and `match_string` are **mutually exclusive** — you must provide exactly one of them in each `Fts` object.","locale":"en"},"2316":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-49","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"The following operators are supported in `query_string` expressions:","locale":"en"},"2317":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-50","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Syntax","locale":"en"},"2318":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-51","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"2319":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-52","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Example","locale":"en"},"2320":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-53","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`term`","locale":"en"},"2321":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-54","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Match a single term","locale":"en"},"2322":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-55","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`vector`","locale":"en"},"2323":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-56","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`\"phrase\"`","locale":"en"},"2324":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-57","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Match an exact phrase (word order and adjacency)","locale":"en"},"2325":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-58","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`\"machine learning\"`","locale":"en"},"2326":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-59","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`+term`","locale":"en"},"2327":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-60","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Term **must** appear in the document","locale":"en"},"2328":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-61","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`+vector`","locale":"en"},"2329":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-62","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`-term`","locale":"en"},"2330":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-63","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Term **must not** appear in the document","locale":"en"},"2331":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-64","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`-slow`","locale":"en"},"2332":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-65","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`a AND b`","locale":"en"},"2333":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-66","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Both terms must match","locale":"en"},"2334":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-67","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`vector AND search`","locale":"en"},"2335":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-68","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`a OR b`","locale":"en"},"2336":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-69","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Either term can match","locale":"en"},"2337":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-70","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`vector OR embedding`","locale":"en"},"2338":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-71","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`a NOT b`","locale":"en"},"2339":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-72","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Match `a` but exclude documents matching `b`","locale":"en"},"2340":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-73","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`learning NOT deep`","locale":"en"},"2341":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-74","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`(expr)`","locale":"en"},"2342":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-75","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Group sub-expressions","locale":"en"},"2343":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-76","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`(vector OR embedding) AND search`","locale":"en"},"2344":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-77","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`+(expr)`","locale":"en"},"2345":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-78","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Group must match","locale":"en"},"2346":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-79","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`+(vector OR embedding)`","locale":"en"},"2347":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-80","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`-(expr)`","locale":"en"},"2348":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-81","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Group must not match","locale":"en"},"2349":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-82","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"`-(slow AND outdated)`","locale":"en"},"2350":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-83","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"**Operator precedence**: `AND` / `NOT` bind tighter than `OR`. Adjacent terms without an explicit operator are combined using the `default_operator` setting (default: `OR`).","locale":"en"},"2351":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-84","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"For complex queries mixing multiple operators, **use `()` to make grouping explicit** and avoid unexpected results.","locale":"en"},"2352":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-85","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-syntax-reference","content":"Leading negation is not supported — both `NOT term` and standalone `-term` require at least one positive term. Use `a NOT b` or combine `-term` with positive terms (e.g., `a -b`).","locale":"en"},"2353":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-86","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-parameters","content":"Parameter","locale":"en"},"2354":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-87","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-parameters","content":"Description","locale":"en"},"2355":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-88","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-parameters","content":"`topk`","locale":"en"},"2356":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-89","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-parameters","content":"The number of top-scoring documents to return.","locale":"en"},"2357":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-90","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-parameters","content":"`filter`","locale":"en"},"2358":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-91","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-parameters","content":"An optional SQL-like boolean expression to restrict results. See conditional filtering for details.","locale":"en"},"2359":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-92","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-parameters","content":"`output_fields`","locale":"en"},"2360":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-93","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#query-parameters","content":"An optional list of scalar field names to include in results. If omitted, all scalar fields are returned.","locale":"en"},"2361":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-94","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#default-operator","content":"By default, adjacent bare terms in both `match_string` and `query_string` are combined with `OR`. To change this to `AND`, pass a `FtsQueryParam` via the `param` field:","locale":"en"},"2362":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-95","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#default-operator","content":"With `default_operator=\"AND\"`, this returns only documents containing **both** \"machine\" **and** \"learning\".","locale":"en"},"2363":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-96","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#default-operator","content":"Explicit operators (`AND`, `OR`, `+`, `-`) in a `query_string` are not affected by `default_operator` — it only controls how adjacent bare terms are combined.","locale":"en"},"2364":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-97","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#combining-fts-with-scalar-filters","content":"You can combine full-text search with scalar filters to narrow results:","locale":"en"},"2365":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts-98","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/fts#combining-fts-with-scalar-filters","content":"FTS and vector search are **mutually exclusive within one query route**. A single `Query` / `ZVecQuery` should not set both `fts` and `vector` / `id`; use separate query routes with re-ranking, or run separate queries and merge results in your application.","locale":"en"},"236