oup#limitations-and-considerations","content":"Grouped search supports only single-vector search. It does not support full-text search or multi-vector search.","locale":"en"},"2570":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-118","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#limitations-and-considerations","content":"The grouping field cannot be a vector or array field.","locale":"en"},"2571":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-119","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#limitations-and-considerations","content":"Grouped search currently does not support IVF, DiskANN, or Vamana vector indexes.","locale":"en"},"2572":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-120","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#limitations-and-considerations","content":"Grouped search cannot be used with vector refinement (refiner).","locale":"en"},"2573":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-121","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#limitations-and-considerations","content":"Grouped search is best-effort. Depending on the data distribution and search conditions, the actual number of groups and documents per group may be lower than the specified values. When there are not enough candidates, Zvec prioritizes the number of groups.","locale":"en"},"2574":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group-122","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/group#limitations-and-considerations","content":"Increasing the number of groups or documents per group requires collecting and sorting more candidates and typically increases query latency.","locale":"en"},"2575":{"id":"/en/do