-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector#common-parameters","content":"Description","locale":"en"},"2678":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector-28","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector#common-parameters","content":"`topk`","locale":"en"},"2679":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector-29","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector#common-parameters","content":"The number of most similar documents to return.","locale":"en"},"2680":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector-30","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector#common-parameters","content":"`include_vector`","locale":"en"},"2681":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector-31","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector#common-parameters","content":"If `True`, the returned `Doc` objects include the full vector embeddings (disabled by default for performance).","locale":"en"},"2682":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector-32","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector#common-parameters","content":"`output_fields`","locale":"en"},"2683":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector-33","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/single-vector#common-parameters","content":"An optional list of scalar field names to include in results. If omitted, all scalar fields are returned.","locale":"en"},"2684":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/