":"/zh/docs/db-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"⚡ **极致高效**：毫秒级响应，轻松检索数十亿级向量。","locale":"zh"},"2914":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"🧩 **开箱即用**：纯本地运行 — 安装后几分钟内就能开始搜索。无需服务器、无需复杂配置。","locale":"zh"},"2915":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"✨ **稠密 + 稀疏向量**：支持稠密向量和稀疏向量，提供多向量联合查询的原生支持。","locale":"zh"},"2916":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"🎯 **混合搜索**：向量语义搜索 + 标量条件过滤，获得精确结果。","locale":"zh"},"2917":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"🛡️ **持久存储**：WAL 预写日志保障数据持久性 — 即使进程崩溃或意外断电，数据也不会丢失。","locale":"zh"},"2918":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"🔒 **并发访问**：支持多进程同时读取同一个 Collection；写入为单进程独占模式。","locale":"zh"},"2919":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#核心特性","content":"📦 **进程内运行**：无需单独部署服务，纯进程内运行。Notebook、高性能服务器、CLI 工具、边缘设备 — 随处可用。","locale":"zh"},"2920":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"Jupyter Notebook 教程\" href=\"/downloads/walkthrough-zh.zip\" description=\"运行多模态图像检索的交互式教程\" icon=\"<Download className=&#x22;text-teal-300&#x22; />\" />","locale":"zh"},"2921":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"AI 友好文档\" href=\"./ai-friendly/\" description=\"将 Zvec 文档提供给 AI 编程助手阅读\" icon=\"<Bot className=&#x22;text-teal-300&#x22; />\" />","locale":"zh"},"2922":{"id":"/zh/docs/db-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"快速开始\" href=\"./quickstart/\" description=\"轻松入门，开箱即用\" icon=\"<Rocket className=&#x22;t