-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#结构化代码","content":"Python","locale":"zh"},"3542":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#结构化代码","content":"Rust","locale":"zh"},"3543":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#结构化代码","content":"Vue 和 Svelte 文件中的脚本代码也会尽可能使用结构化提取。","locale":"zh"},"3544":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"内容","locale":"zh"},"3545":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"索引表示","locale":"zh"},"3546":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"Markdown 与 MDX","locale":"zh"},"3547":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"标题章节和面包屑","locale":"zh"},"3548":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"TXT、RST、HTML、XML","locale":"zh"},"3549":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#文档与结构化文本","content":"纯文本切块","locale":"zh"},"3550":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type"