oting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","content":"先运行三项检查：","locale":"zh"},"3568":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#找不到-zg-命令","content":"通过 npm 安装时需要 Node.js 14.14 或更新版本；`zg` 本身是原生可执行文件：","locale":"zh"},"3569":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#找不到-zg-命令","content":"如果 npm 安装成功但仍找不到 `zg`，请将 npm 的全局二进制目录加入 shell 的 `PATH`。","locale":"zh"},"3570":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#找不到-zg-命令","content":"如果 npm 跳过了包的安装脚本，请允许执行这些脚本，再运行 `npm rebuild -g @zvec/zvec-grep --allow-scripts=@zvec/zvec-grep --foreground-scripts` 生成原生可执行文件。","locale":"zh"},"3571":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#索引不存在或已过期","content":"在预期的工作区根目录中运行：","locale":"zh"},"3572":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#索引不存在或已过期","content":"更换 Embedding 模型或状态提示索引不兼容时，使用 `--rebuild`。索引不兼容时请重新指定所需模型和扫描规则，已有数据不会原地迁移。","locale":"zh"},"3573":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#检索结果为空或质量较弱","content":"已知文本、标识符、路径或正则时使用 `--rg`。","locale":"zh"},"3574":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#检索结果为空或质量较弱","content":"已知关键词但需要排序时使用 `--fts`。","locale":"zh"},"3575":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/tro