":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"何时使用 DiskANN 索引？","locale":"zh"},"4392":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4393":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4394":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4395":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4396":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4397":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"一种基于磁盘的图索引，专为**十亿级**向量搜索设计 — 将压缩向量保存在内存中，全精度向量存储在磁盘上，实现高 Recall 的近似最近邻搜索，同时**大幅降低内存占用**。","locale":"zh"},"4398":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"DiskANN 由 Subramanya 等人在 NeurIPS 2019 论文 DiskANN: Fast Accurate Billion-point Nearest Neighbor Search on a Single Node 中提出。","locale":"zh"},"4399":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"**平台支持**：DiskANN 目前**仅支持 Linux** 平台。","locale":"zh"},"4400":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"**`libaio` 为可选依赖。** 如果系统已安装 `libaio`，DiskANN 会使用 Linux 异步 I/O 以获得更好的性能；如果未安装，DiskANN 仍可通过备用 I/O 路径正常运行，但查询性能可能略低。","locale":"zh"},"4401":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"不过，由于查询路径涉及磁盘 I/O，DiskANN 的 **QPS 低于纯内存索引**（如 HNSW），因此更适合对吞吐和延迟不敏感、但需要在受限内存下处理超大规模数据的场景。","locale":"zh"},"4402":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"DiskANN 在完整数据集上构建 Vamana 图，并将其与原始向量一起存储在磁盘上。搜索时，仅 PQ（乘积量化）压缩编码驻留在内存中，图和全精度向量按需从磁盘读取。","locale":"zh"},"4403":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**Vamana 图用于导航** 🪜","locale":"zh"},"4404":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"单层图结构，每个节点最多连接 `max_degree` 个邻居。","locale":"zh"},"4405":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"图的构建采用贪心搜索-剪枝策略，通过 **alpha 参数**鼓励长距离边，实现快速收敛到查询点的邻域。","locale":"zh"},"4406":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**中心点**（medoid，距数据集质心最近的点）作为每次搜索的固定入口。","locale":"zh"},"4407":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**乘积量化（PQ）用于距离估计** 🔍","locale":"zh"},"4408":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"向量空间被划分为 `pq_chunk_num` 个子空间，每个子向量被量化为 256 个质心的码本（8-bit PQ 编码）。","locale":"zh"},"4409":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"查询时，预先计算查询向量的 **PQ 距离查找表**，通过快速表查找而非全精度运算来计算候选点的近似距离。","locale":"zh"},"4410":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**带缓存的束搜索** 🔎","locale":"zh"},"4411":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"搜索从中心点开始，使用**束搜索**（beam search）策略探索图 — 多个前沿节点通过批量磁盘 I/O 并发扩展。","locale":"zh"},"4412":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"入口点附近的高频访问节点被缓存在内存中（**BFS 层级缓存**），减少热点区域的磁盘读取。","locale":"zh"},"4413":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"对于每个访问的节点，使用 PQ 编码计算近似距离，并从磁盘读取全精度向量为 top-k 候选结果计算精确距离。","locale":"zh"},"4414":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"✅ **无法完全装入内存**的十亿级数据集","locale":"zh"},"4415":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"✅ 对成本敏感、需要最小化内存消耗的部署场景","locale":"zh"},"4416":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"✅ 可以容忍相比内存索引稍高延迟的批处理工作负载和离线分析","locale":"zh"},"4417":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"**最佳实践**：当数据集远超可用内存时使用 DiskANN。它以仅与 PQ 编码成比例的内存消耗提供出色的 Recall。如果数据集可以装入内存，建议使用 HNSW 或 HNSW-RaBitQ 以获得更低延迟。","locale":"zh"},"4418":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"✨ **极低的内存占用** — 仅 PQ 压缩编码（每向量每 chunk 1 字节）驻留内存，使十亿级搜索在普通硬件上成为可能","locale":"zh"},"4419":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"✨ **高 Recall** — Vamana 图通过基于 alpha 的剪枝保持连通性和多样性，最终候选结果重新计算精确距离","locale":"zh"},"4420":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"✨ **可扩展的图构建** — 采用简单的贪心插入-剪枝算法，可跨线程并行化","locale":"zh"},"4421":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **较高的查询延迟** — 每次搜索需要磁盘 I/O 进行图遍历，比纯内存索引（如 HNSW）慢","locale":"zh"},"4422":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **构建时 PQ 训练开销** — 索引构建前需要基于 KMeans 的 PQ 训练步骤，增加总构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4423":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **不适合实时工作负载** — 磁盘访问延迟意味着 DiskANN 更适合面向可容忍延迟或 QPS 要求相对低的场景","locale":"zh"},"4424":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#关键参数","content":"**调参建议**：\n从默认值开始。先调整查询时的 `list_size` 来权衡 Recall 和延迟。仅在需要更好 Recall 时增加 `max_degree` — 但预期会增加磁盘占用和构建时间。如果需要进一步降低内存且可接受稍低 Recall，可减少 `pq_chunk_num`。","locale":"zh"},"4425":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4426":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4427":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4428":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4429":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的**相似度度量**","locale":"zh"},"4430":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"根据 Embedding 模型的训练方式选择","locale":"zh"},"4431":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`max_degree`","locale":"zh"},"4432":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"**每个节点的最大邻居数** — Vamana 图中每个节点的最大边数","locale":"zh"},"4433":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `max_degree` →  ✨ 更好的 Recall 和图连通性  ⚠️ 更多磁盘占用和更长的构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4434":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`list_size`","locale":"zh"},"4435":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"**构建时候选列表大小** — 插入新向量时图构建过程中考虑的候选数量","locale":"zh"},"4436":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `list_size` →  ✨ 更好的图质量和更高的 Recall  ⚠️ 更长的索引构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4437":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`pq_chunk_num`","locale":"zh"},"4438":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"**PQ 子空间数量** — 控制向量维度如何划分以进行乘积量化","locale":"zh"},"4439":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更多 chunk →  ✨ 更精细的距离近似和更好的 Recall  ⚠️ PQ 编码占用更多内存（每向量每 chunk 1 字节）","locale":"zh"},"4440":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4441":{