lat-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4449":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"何时使用 Flat 索引","locale":"zh"},"4450":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4451":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#局限","content":"局限","locale":"zh"},"4452":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#工作原理","content":"通过将查询向量与数据集中的所有向量逐一比对，实现精确相似性检索 (暴力检索)。","locale":"zh"},"4453":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 小规模数据集","locale":"zh"},"4454":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 原型设计与实验阶段","locale":"zh"},"4455":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 作为评估基准","locale":"zh"},"4456":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 对召回率要求 100% 且不可妥协的场景","locale":"zh"},"4457":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"**最佳实践**：在开发和测试阶段，建议先使用 Flat 索引 — 把它当作你的正确性基准。一旦方案验证通过，再考虑使用近似索引 (如 HNSW) 来获得生产级别的性能。对于数据量极小 (比如30万条向量的规模) 且正确性优于速度的场景，Flat Index 也是一个完全可行的选择。","locale":"zh"},"4458":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"✨ **完美 Recall 保证** — 能找到真正的最近邻","locale":"zh"},"4459":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"✨ **零配置** — 简单设置，无需调参","locale":"zh"},"4460":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"✨ **即时索引** — 构建时间几乎为零","locale":"zh"},"4461":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#局限","content":"⚠️ 搜索延迟随数据量大小呈线性增长 —  这意味着它难以支撑大规模的工作负载。","locale":"zh"},"4462":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"page","content":"HNSW 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","locale":"zh"},"4463":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","content":"一种基于图结构的索引，也是实现低延迟相似度检索的首选方案 — 它以较高的内存占用为代价，提供了业界顶尖的检索速度和召回率。","locale":"zh"},"4464":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4465":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"何时使用 HNSW 索引？","locale":"zh"},"4466":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4467":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4468":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4469":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4470":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4471":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"HNSW 构建了一个**多层图结构**，其中每个节点代表一个向量，节点间的边则根据相似度建立连接。","locale":"zh"},"4472":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"层级化的多层布局 🪜","locale":"zh"},"4473":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**上层**：结构稀疏且节点较少，充当“高速公路”，用于实现快速的长距离导航。","locale":"zh"},"4474":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**下层**：结构稠密且包含更多节点，提供细粒度的局部邻域连接。","locale":"zh"},"4475":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"搜索过程（从粗粒度到细粒度）🔍","locale":"zh"},"4476":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"从顶层的**入口节点**开始。","locale":"zh"},"4477":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"在当前层，以贪心策略走向距离查询向量更近的邻居节点，直到无法再接近为止。","locale":"zh"},"4478":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"然后在该位置**下降一层**，并重复同样的贪心搜索的过程。","locale":"zh"},"4479":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"在**最底层**，以更精细的搜索策略执行该过程 (使用候选集列表)，以得到更准确的结果。","locale":"zh"},"4480":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**为什么 HNSW 既快又准** ⚡ 🎯","locale":"zh"},"4481":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**快**：上层结构可以快速跳转到目标区域，无需遍历绝大多数节点。","locale":"zh"},"4482":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**准**：底层结构稠密，能对局部邻域进行精细化搜索，从而保证高召回率。","locale":"zh"},"4483":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"✅ 实时、低延迟应用 (如对话式 AI 和实时推荐系统)","locale":"zh"},"4484":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"✅ 需要在极低延迟下保持高召回率的生产系统","locale":"zh"},"4485":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"**最佳实践**：HNSW 是我们针对大多数生产环境**推荐的首选方案**。它在速度、准确性和稳定性之间取得了极佳的平衡。","locale":"zh"},"4486":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"✨ **近似于对数级的查询时间** — 对于大型数据集，通常能达到 &#x2A;*O(log n)** 的效率","locale":"zh"},"4487":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"✨ 具备极强的适应性，在多种数据分布下**均能维持高召回率**","locale":"zh"},"4488":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"✨ 索引**构建速度比许多替代方案都要快** (如基于 IVF 的方法)","locale":"zh"},"4489":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **内存占用较高** — 图结构的连接关系需要额外的存储空间 (随 `m` 增长)","locale":"zh"},"4490":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ &#x2A;*索引构建时间复杂度为 O(n log n)** — 构建时间比 Flat 索引慢 (但通常比 IVF 快)","locale":"zh"},"4491":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#关键参数","content":"**调参建议**：先从默认值开始，然后优先调整 `ef` 来平衡召回率和延迟。只有在必要时，才增加 `ef_construction` 或 `m` 来提升精度 — 这会降低索引构建的速度并增加内存使用。","locale":"zh"},"4492":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4493":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4494":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4495":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4496":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的**相似度度量**","locale":"zh"},"4497":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"根据 Embedding 模型的训练方式选择","locale":"zh"},"4498":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`m`","locale":"zh"},"4499":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"**每个节点的最大邻居数** — 构建图过程中为每个节点创建的最大双向连接数量","locale":"zh"},"4500":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `m` →  ✨ 召回率更高，图连通性更好  ⚠️ 内存占用更多，索引和检索的延迟都会增加","locale":"zh"},"4501":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`ef_construction`","locale":"zh"},"4502":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"**构建索引时的候选池大小** — 决定了算法在插入新向量时会考察多少个邻居候选项","locale":"zh"},"4503":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `ef_construction` →  ✨ 图的质量更好，召回率更高  ⚠️ 索引构建时间更长 (*不影响查询速度*)","locale":"zh"},"4504":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`quantize_type`","locale":"zh"},"4505":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"向量**量化**方式  默认不开启量化","locale":"zh"},"4506":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"详见量化","locale":"zh"},"4507":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4508":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4509":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4510":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`ef`","locale":"zh"},"4511":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"**查询时的候选池大小** — 决定了在图遍历过程中每一步会探索多少个潜在邻居","locale":"zh"},"4512":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"• 更大的 `ef` →  ✨ 召回率更高  ⚠️  查询延迟也会增加  💡 如果发现 `ef=300` 时搜不到想要的结果，不妨试着调到 `500` 或甚至更高，以此来扩大搜索范围。","locale":"zh"},"4513":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`radius`","locale":"zh"},"4514":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"**距离(相似度)阈值**，用于范围过滤 — 只有满足该阈值的 documents 才会被返回","locale":"zh"},"4515":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"示例： • 使用内积 `MetricType.IP` 时，设置 `radius=0.6` 仅保留分数 > 0.6 的结果  ✅ 适用于：想要剔除掉低质量匹配的结果  🚫 不适用于：必须返回全部 top-K 个结果，不关心分数质量","locale":"zh"},"4516":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`is_linear`","locale":"zh"},"4517":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"强制使用**暴力线性检索** (不使用配置的索引)","locale":"zh"},"4518":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"🐌 大数据集下非常慢！ ✅ 仅用于：调试、超小数据集或验证索引准确性","locale":"zh"},"4519":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`is_using_refiner`","locale":"zh"},"4520":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"对头部候选结果**启用精排** (重新计算精确的相似度分数) — 在开启了**量化**的场景下有帮助，能挽回精度损失，提高召回质量","locale":"zh"},"4521":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"✅ 在启用量化的场景下，如需得到更高精度时开启精排  ⚠️ 注意：因为要重新精确计算分数，所以会增加查询延迟","locale":"zh"},"4522":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"page","content":"HNSW-RaBitQ 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","locale":"zh"},"4523":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","content":"HNSW + RaBitQ 量化","locale":"zh"},"4524":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4525":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"何时使用 HNSW-RaBitQ？","locale":"zh"},"4526":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4527":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4528":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4529":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4530":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4531":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","content":"一种先进的基于图的索引，将 HNSW 图结构与 RaBitQ 量化算法相结合 — 在保持一流搜索质量的同时**大幅降低内存使用**。","locale":"zh"},"4532":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","content":"HNSW-RaBitQ 支持 Linux x86\\_64 或 Windows x86\\_64，CPU 需支持 AVX2 或 AVX-512。Zvec 会自动选择最佳运行时。","locale":"zh"},"4533":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"HNSW-RaBitQ 结合两项技术实现高 Recall 和低内存占用：","locale":"zh"},"4534":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"**HNSW 图用于导航** 🪜","locale":"zh"},"4535":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"与标准 HNSW 索引相同的多层图结构 — 上层稀疏用于快速远距离跳转，下层密集用于细粒度局部搜索。","locale":"zh"},"4536":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"**RaBitQ 用于距离估计** 🔍","locale":"zh"},"4537":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"RaBitQ 先对向量进行**随机旋转**，然后将其转换为**二进制编码**（0 和 1）。这种方法允许系统通过高效的位运算来估计距离，与处理全精度数值相比，显著**降低了内存使用和计算成本**。","locale":"zh"},"4538":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"✅ 需要快速搜索、高 Recall 且内存预算可控的生产系统","locale":"zh"},"4539":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"✅ 超大规模高维数据集 — 十亿级 1536+ 维向量在 FP32 格式下会消耗 TB 级内存","locale":"zh"},"4540":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"✅ 运行环境为 Linux x86\\_64 或 Windows x86\\_64，CPU 需支持 AVX2 或 AVX-512","locale":"zh"},"4541":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"**最佳实践**：当你希望获得 HNSW 级别的搜索质量而无需承担高内存开销时，使用 HNSW-RaBitQ。","locale":"zh"},"4542":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"`total_bits` 参数控制精度-内存的权衡。根据论文，在特定数据集上，**7 位**可达约 99% Recall，**5 位**约 95%，**4 位**约 90%。最低可使用 **1 位**以最大化压缩，但会降低 Recall。","locale":"zh"},"4543":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **大幅降低内存** — 量化后的向量最多比 FP32 小 32 倍，减少活跃索引大小","locale":"zh"},"4544":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **高效距离估计** — RaBitQ 支持基于位运算的高效相似度计算","locale":"zh"},"4545":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **无需重排序即可获得出色 Recall** — 图构建使用原始向量，保持图质量；RaBitQ 提供渐近最优的误差界，确保排序可靠","locale":"zh"},"4546":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **平台受限** — Linux x86\\_64 或 Windows x86\\_64，CPU 需支持 AVX2 或 AVX-512","locale":"zh"},"4547":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **训练开销** — 索引构建前需要 KMeans 训练步骤，增加构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4548":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **维度限制** — 仅支持 64 到 4095 维之间的向量","locale":"zh"},"4549":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#关键参数","content":"**调参建议**：\n从默认值开始（`total_bits=7`，`num_clusters=16`）。先调整查询时的 `ef` 来权衡 Recall 和延迟。仅在需要进一步降低内存且可接受稍低 Recall 时减小 `total_bits`。","locale":"zh"},"4550":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4551":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4552":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4553":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4554":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的相似度度量","locale":"zh"},"4555":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"根据 Embedding 模型的训练方式选择","locale":"zh"},"4556":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`m`","locale":"zh"},"4557":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**每个节点的最大邻居数** — 图构建过程中为每个节点创建的最大双向链接数","locale":"zh"},"4558":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `m` →  ✨ 更好的 Recall 和图连通性  ⚠️ 更多内存使用，索引和搜索延迟更高","locale":"zh"},"4559":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/do