nsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**KMeans 聚类数** — 在 RaBitQ 训练阶段用于划分向量空间","locale":"zh"},"4567":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更多聚类可捕获更精细的分布模式  • 更高的值可略微提升 Recall","locale":"zh"},"4568":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`sample_count`","locale":"zh"},"4569":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**训练样本数** — KMeans 训练采样的向量数量（`0` = 使用全部向量）","locale":"zh"},"4570":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"默认为 `0`。在超大数据集上设置较小的值（如 5,000,000）可加速训练并减少内存使用","locale":"zh"},"4571":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4572":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4573":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"调参指南","local