vf-rabitq-index-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"`is_linear`","locale":"zh"},"4737":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"`False`","locale":"zh"},"4738":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-68","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"强制使用暴力线性检索，而不使用 IVF-RaBitQ 索引","locale":"zh"},"4739":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-69","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"仅用于调试、小型 Collection 或验证索引结果；大数据集下开销很高","locale":"zh"},"4740":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-70","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"`is_using_refiner`","locale":"zh"},"4741":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-71","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"`False`","locale":"zh"},"4742":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-72","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"使用原始 FP32 向量对量化检索候选重新计算精确分数","locale":"zh"},"4743":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-73","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"需要更高精度时启用，但会增加候选读取和精确距离计算开销","locale":"zh"},"4744":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-74","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"`scale_factor`","locale":"zh"},"4745":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-75","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"`10.0`","locale":"zh"},"4746":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-76","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"启用 Refiner 时的候选扩展倍数","locale":"zh"},"4747":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-77","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"更大的值为精化阶段提供更多候选，通常有利于 Recall，但会增加延迟；仅在 `is_using_refiner=True` 时生效","locale":"zh"},"4748":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-78","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"Node.js 中 `nprobe` 和 `radius` 名称不变，其余参数使用 `isLinear`、`isUsingRefiner` 和 `scaleFactor`。","locale":"zh"},"4749":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"page","content":"量化","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","locale":"zh"},"4750":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"存储行为","locale":"zh"},"4751":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#启用量化","content":"启用量化","locale":"zh"},"4752":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"量化类型","locale":"zh"},"4753":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#fp16-半精度浮点","content":"FP16 (半精度浮点)","locale":"zh"},"4754":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#int8-8位整数量化","content":"INT8 (8位整数量化)","locale":"zh"},"4755":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#int4-4位整数量化","content":"INT4 (4位整数量化)","locale":"zh"},"4756":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#启用旋转","content":"启用旋转","locale":"zh"},"4757":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"量化是一种压缩技术，&#x2A;**它将向量从原始格式 (如 FP32) 转换为更紧凑的表示形式***，从而减小用于搜检索的向量索引的大小。","locale":"zh"},"4758":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"这种转换通过减少每个维度所用的比特数，来近似原始向量，从而实现：","locale":"zh"},"4759":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"✨ 更低的**内存占用** — 尤其当索引常驻内存时；","locale":"zh"},"4760":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"✨ 更快的 I/O 速度和更低的查询延迟 — 减少了数据传输开销，还充分利用了高效的整数或半精度浮点 (FP16) 计算；","locale":"zh"},"4761":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"✨ 在资源受限的硬件上实现更好的可扩展性。","locale":"zh"},"4762":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"**重要**：","locale":"zh"},"4763":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"量化是一种**有损且不可逆**的压缩方法。它以**可能降低召回率为代价**，换取更高的运行时效率。请务必验证其对检索质量的影响。","locale":"zh"},"4764":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"量化仅在应用于 **FP32** 格式的向量时才能带来收益。","locale":"zh"},"4765":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"为确保数据完整性和灵活性，**Zvec 同时存储原始向量及其量化版本**。这意味着：","locale":"zh"},"4766":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"**磁盘上的总存储占用可能会增加** (因为保存了两份副本)。","locale":"zh"},"4767":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"构建索引和检索时**只需加载量化后的向量**，大幅减少内存占用。","locale":"zh"},"4768":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"用户随时都能按需取回**原始的完整向量**。","locale":"zh"},"4769":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#启用量化","content":"你可以在创建向量索引时，**通过在 `VectorSchema` 中设置 `quantize_type` 参数** (例如 `FP16`、`INT8` 或 `INT4`) 来开启量化功能。","locale":"zh"},"4770":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#启用量化","content":"配置完成后，Zvec 会自动在原始向量的基础上，生成并管理对应的量化版本。","locale":"zh"},"4771":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#fp16-半精度浮点","content":"使用16位浮点数来表示向量，在大幅减少内存占用并加快计算速度的同时，依然能保持极高的数值精度。非常适合那些需要接近 FP32 精度，但又希望提升运行效率的应用场景。(需由 FP32 源数据转换而来)","locale":"zh"},"4772":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#int8-8位整数量化","content":"使用8位整数来表示向量，显著降低了存储需求和内存带宽压力。对于许多相似度检索任务，提供了速度、大小和检索精度之间的良好平衡。(需由 FP32 源数据转换而来)","locale":"zh"},"4773":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#int4-4位整数量化","content":"一种极致紧凑的表示方式，每个维度仅需4位。它能最大化存储密度并提升推理速度，非常适合对延迟极其敏感或硬件资源受限的环境 (前提是你能接受较多的精度损失)。(需由 FP32 源数据转换而来)","locale":"zh"},"4774":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#启用旋转","content":"在启用 `INT8` 或 `INT4` 量化时，你可以通过在 `VectorSchema` 中设置 `quantizer_param` 参数，**指定 `enable_rotate=True` 来开启旋转**。该功能会在量化前对向量施加一次随机正交旋转，使各维度的分布更加均匀，从而减小量化过程中的信息损失，提高量化后索引的召回率。","locale":"zh"},"4775":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","type":"page","content":"创建","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","Collection","创建"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","locale":"zh"},"4776":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#创建并打开-collection","content":"创建并打开 Collection","locale":"zh"},"4777":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#实战示例-商品搜索","content":"实战示例：🛒 商品搜索","locale":"zh"},"4778":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#️-标量字段用于过滤和展示","content":"🗂️ 标量字段：用于过滤和展示","locale":"zh"},"4779":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#-向量用于语义相关性检索","content":"📐 向量：用于语义相关性检索","locale":"zh"},"4780":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#创建并打开-collection","content":"要在 Zvec 中创建一个新的 collection，需要定义以下内容：","locale":"zh"},"4781":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#创建并打开-collection","content":"**Schema** — 数据的结构定义，用于指定标量和向量字段。","locale":"zh"},"4782":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#创建并打开-collection","content":"**Collection 选项** (可选) — 控制 Collection 的运行时行为 (如只读模式)。","locale":"zh"},"4783":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#创建并打开-collection","content":"定义完成后，调用 `create_and_open()` 即可在指定路径初始化新 collection，并返回一个可用于插入和查询的 `Collection` 对象。","locale":"zh"},"4784":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#创建并打开-collection","content":"如果指定路径下已存在 collection，`create_and_open()` 将抛出错误以防止意外覆盖。","locale":"zh"},"4785":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#创建并打开-collection","content":"<Card icon=\"<TableOfContents className=&#x22;text-fd-primary&#x22; />\" title=\"Schema\" href=\"./schema/\" />","locale":"zh"},"4786":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#创建并打开-collection","content":"<Card icon=\"<Settings className=&#x22;text-fd-primary&#x22; />\" title=\"Collection 选项\" href=\"./options/\" />","locale":"zh"},"4787":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#实战示例-商品搜索","content":"如下 schema 建模了一个**多模态商品搜索系统**，结合视觉、文本和结构化元数据实现丰富的检索功能：","locale":"zh"},"4788":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#️-标量字段用于过滤和展示","content":"`category` (字符串数组，启用索引)：支持类似 `category CONTAIN_ANY (\"electronics\", \"headphones\")` 的查询，用于查找属于“电子产品”或“耳机” (或两者皆是) 的商品。","locale":"zh"},"4789":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#️-标量字段用于过滤和展示","content":"`price` (整数，启用索引并带有范围优化)：支持快速范围查询，如 `price > 100`。","locale":"zh"},"4790":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#️-标量字段用于过滤和展示","content":"`in_stock`(布尔值，启用索引)：支持按库存状态过滤 (例如“仅显示有货商品”)。","locale":"zh"},"4791":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#️-标量字段用于过滤和展示","content":"`image_url` 和 `description` 仅存储但**不启用索引**，因为它们仅用于展示。","locale":"zh"},"4792":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#-向量用于语义相关性检索","content":"两个稠密向量捕获语义信息：","locale":"zh"},"4793":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#-向量用于语义相关性检索","content":"`image_vec`：用商品图片生成的512维向量 (如来自视觉模型)。","locale":"zh"},"4794":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#-向量用于语义相关性检索","content":"`description_vec`：用商品文字描述生成的768维向量 (如来自语言嵌入模型)，启用量化存储。","locale":"zh"},"4795":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#-向量用于语义相关性检索","content":"一个稀疏向量 `keywords_sparse` 用于关键词匹配，支持混合稀疏-稠密检索。","locale":"zh"},"4796":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","type":"page","content":"选项","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","Collection","创建"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","locale":"zh"},"4797":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","content":"`CollectionOption` 让用户在创建或打开一个 collection 时，对它的运行时行为进行精确控制：","locale":"zh"},"4798":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","content":"`read_only`：以只读模式打开 collection。在此模式下，任何尝试写入数据的操作均会触发错误异常。","locale":"zh"},"4799":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","content":"**注意**：使用 `create_and_open()` 时，`read_only` 必须设为 `False`。这是因为 collection 的创建过程需要创建并写入文件。","locale":"zh"},"4800":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","content":"`enable_mmap`：启用内存映射 I/O 以实现更高效的数据访问 (默认为 `True`)。该机制通过略微增加内存缓存的占用，来换取显著的性能提升。","locale":"zh"},"4801":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","type":"page","content":"Schema","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","Collection","创建"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","locale":"zh"},"4802":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#collection-名称-step","content":"Collection 名称","locale":"zh"},"4803":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"标量字段","locale":"zh"},"4804":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"向量（Embedding）","locale":"zh"},"4805":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"选择向量索引类型","locale":"zh"},"4806":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#完整-schema-示例","content":"完整 Schema 示例","locale":"zh"},"4807":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"**Collection Schema** `CollectionSchema` 定义了插入到 collection 中的每个 document 必须遵循的结构。","locale":"zh"},"4808":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"Zvec 的 schema 是**动态的**：你可以随时添加或删除标量和向量字段，而无需重建 collection。","locale":"zh"},"4809":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"`CollectionSchema` 包含三个部分：","locale":"zh"},"4810":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"`name`：collection 的标识符。","locale":"zh"},"4811":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"`fields`：标量字段列表。","locale":"zh"},"4812":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"`vectors`：向量字段列表。","locale":"zh"},"4813":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#collection-名称-step","content":"Collection 标识符。此名称用于内部引用和日志记录。","locale":"zh"},"4814":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"标量字段存储非向量（即结构化）数据，如字符串、数字、布尔值或数组。","locale":"zh"},"4815":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"每个字段通过 `FieldSchema` 定义，包含以下属性：","locale":"zh"},"4816":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`name`：字段在 collection 中的唯一字符串标识符。","locale":"zh"},"4817":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`data_type`：存储的数据类型 — 如 `STRING`、`INT64` 或数组类型 `ARRAY_STRING`。","locale":"zh"},"4818":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`nullable` (可选)：是否允许该字段为**空值** (默认为 `False`)。","locale":"zh"},"4819":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`index_param` (可选)：通过 `InvertIndexParam` 创建倒排索引实现快速过滤，或通过 `FtsIndexParam` 创建全文索引实现全文检索。","locale":"zh"},"4820":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"请为需要检索的标量字段添加索引。未索引的字段能节省存储和写入开销。","locale":"zh"},"4821":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"对于**倒排索引** (`InvertIndexParam`)，还可以选择性地开启一些能提升性能 (但会增加存储成本) 的功能：","locale":"zh"},"4822":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`enable_range_optimization=True` → 加速范围查询 (如 `price > 100`)","locale":"zh"},"4823":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`enable_extended_wildcard=True` → 支持复杂的字符串模式匹配 (如 `name LIKE 'abc%def'`)","locale":"zh"},"4824":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"对于**全文索引** (`FtsIndexParam`)，需要配置分词器和 Token 过滤器。详见全文检索。","locale":"zh"},"4825":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"使用 `VectorSchema` 定义向量字段，包含以下属性：","locale":"zh"},"4826":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"`name`：向量在 collection 中的唯一字符串标识符。","locale":"zh"},"4827":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"`data_type`：向量的数值格式。","locale":"zh"},"4828":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"稠密向量：`VECTOR_FP32`、`VECTOR_FP16` 等。","locale":"zh"},"4829":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"稀疏向量：`SPARSE_VECTOR_FP32`、`SPARSE_VECTOR_FP16`。","locale":"zh"},"4830":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"`dimension`：向量维度 (稠密向量必填项)。","locale":"zh"},"4831":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"`index_param`：用于配置向量索引的类型及相似度度量标准。","locale":"zh"},"4832":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"`index_param` 让你能够灵活配置合适的索引策略：","locale":"zh"},"4833":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"`metric_type`：`COSINE`、`L2` 或 `IP`(内积) — &#x2A;请务必确保你选择的度量方式与 embedding 模型训练方式保持一致!*","locale":"zh"},"4834":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"`quantize_type` (可选)：对向量进行压缩，以减小索引体积并加速检索 (会有轻微的 recall 损失)。","locale":"zh"