llions of vectors, queries can take seconds or minutes, making them impractical for real-time applications."],[1996,"⚠️ **Parameter sensitivity** — `nlist` and `nprobe` must be evaluated against the dataset size, distribution, recall target, and latency budget"],[1936,"⚠️ **Parameter Sensitivity** — Accuracy and latency are highly dependent on the choice of `n_list` and `n_probe`"],[1842,"⚠️ **Platform constraints** — Linux x86\\_64 or Windows x86\\_64 with AVX2 or AVX-512 support"],[1994,"⚠️ **Platform constraints** — Linux x86\\_64 or Windows x86\\_64 with AVX2 or AVX-512 support"],[1332,"⚠️ **Storage overhead**: The index requires additional storage space."],[1232,"⚠️ **Storage overhead**: The inverted map, term frequencies, and position data require additional storage."],[1234,"⚠️ **Tokenizer dependency**: For Chinese ideographs, `standard` indexes individual characters. Use `jieba` when a query should match words."],[1443,"⚠️ **Trade-off**"],[1843,"⚠️ **Training overhead** — Requires a KMeans training step before index construction, adding to build time"],[1333,"⚠️ **Write amplification**: Every write operation — `INSERT`, `UPSERT`, and `UPDATE` — require index maintenance, which adds latency to writes and increases I/O load."],[1233,"⚠️ **Write amplification**: Every write operation requires tokenization and index updates, adding write latency."],[4423,"⚠️ **不适合实时工作负载** — 磁盘访问延迟意味着 DiskANN 更适合面向可容忍延迟或 QPS 要求相对低的场景"],[4489,"⚠️ **内存占用较高** — 图结构的连接关系需要额外的存储空间 (随 `m` 增长)"],[4037,"⚠️ **写放大**：每次写操作 — `INSERT`、`UPSERT` 和 `UPDATE` — 都需要维护索引，增加了写入延迟和 I/O 负载。"],[3937,"⚠️ **写放大**：每次写操作都需要分词并更新倒排索引，增加写入延迟。"],[3938,"⚠️ **分词器依赖**：`standard` 将汉字拆成单字。需要按中文词语检索时，使用 `jieba`。"],[4701,"⚠️ **参数敏感** — `nlist` 和 `nprobe` 需要根据数据规模、分布、Recall 目标及延迟预算进行验证"],[4641,"⚠️ **参数敏感** — 检索的召回率和延迟高度依赖于 `n_list` 和 `n_probe` 的选择"],[4147,"⚠️ **取舍**"],[4595,"⚠️ **大规模下性能极低**：当面对数百万乃至数十亿的向量数据时，查询耗时可能长达数秒甚至数分钟，导致其无法满足实时应用的需求。"],[3936,"⚠️ **存储开销**：倒排映射、词频统计和位置信息需要额外存储空间。"],[4036,"⚠️ **存储开销**：索引需要额外的存储空间。